Package: fakehospdata
Title: Read the Fake NHS Trust Synthetic Hospital Dataset
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Claude", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@anthropic.com")
Description: Downloads a published version of the Fake NHS Trust synthetic
    hospital dataset (the 5% sample from GitHub Pages or the full set from a
    GitHub release) into a local cache and opens it as a DuckDB database with
    one schema per layer and one view per table, so that joins run locally.
    See docs/DESIGN.md and data/README.md in the repository.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
URL: https://github.com/ThomUK/synthetic-hospital-data
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    DBI,
    duckdb,
    jsonlite,
    tools,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
